{"title":"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A bus leaves the station at exactly 7:43 a.m. and arrives at its destination at exactly 8:22 a.m. on the same day. How long, in minutes, was the bus trip?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>7:43 a.m. to 8:00 a.m. is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/e/93ed605eb2f32dacc7393d65b750ae800319c48f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 \\text{ minutes}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" /> and 8:00 a.m. to 8:22 a.m. is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/6/5b6e67939df5f20a5d422cc55c3e3790b245fb86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$22 \\text{ minutes}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"82\" height=\"14\" />, so the bus trip was <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/a/47a1dbc425196858f1468dc159b8600f78865f64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17 + 22 = \\boxed{39 \\text{ minutes}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"176\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC\" title=\"2023 CIMC\">2023 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2023 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&am